an>: You might want to start a sleep diary?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Cute, Sally.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've found writing down my thoughts in a diary to be therapeutical. You might want to try it out. You may even find it helps you develop some good habits!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I guess I can try."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le08ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le08ob02re2aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}